WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.490
<b>Episode 7 
I Entered a Dangerous Dungeon...</b>

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:35.480
<i>If I could be reborn,</i>

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.700
<i>I'd want to be her friend again.</i>

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.810
Let's stop for tea on the way home.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.840
Sure. Want to try 
the new place by the station?

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:45.960
That sounds good!

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:46.780
Right?

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.000
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.850
Please don't die!

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.530
I can't bear the thought 
that I killed someone with my butt!

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.280
Um, I'm fine...

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.730
I'm sorry!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:15.840
H-Hey!

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:18.750
Oh, thank goodness! Are you hurt?

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.480
No, I'm fine.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.310
I'm really, really sorry!

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.660
Don't worry about it.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.990
What were you doing, anyway?

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.880
This tree was practically calling out to me.

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.780
I <i>had</i> to climb it.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.530
But I got ahead of myself, 
and my foot slipped.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:35.670
Wait, what about you? Are you hurt?

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.380
I'm fine.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.680
You're so nice, Sasaki-san.

00:02:39.810 --> 00:02:42.140
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.250
You're Sasaki Atsuko-san, right?

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.510
We're in the same class.

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:47.580
Oh...

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:51.660
I haven't learned the names 
or faces of anyone in our class yet.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.980
I'm sorry.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.420
Really?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:56.510
Then, I'll introduce myself now.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.740
My name is—

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:03.920
<i>She gave me a new world.</i>

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.940
<i>Every day was exciting and fun.</i>

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:12.000
<i>The days I had spent reading books alone 
and never talking to anyone</i>

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.860
<i>didn't seem real anymore.</i>

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:18.760
Acchan... I'm done for.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.540
The rest is up to you.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.270
What are you talking about?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:24.850
It hasn't even been ten minutes yet.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.340
You want to miss out on getting 
into high school this year?

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.560
But I'm just so sleepy...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:35.070
This reference book must have a curse 
on it that makes people sleepy!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.480
Okay, if you pass the exam,

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.020
I'll let you play my most 
prized otome game all you want.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.760
Really?! Thanks, Acchan!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.690
I'll pass the exam to get 
into high school, whatever it takes!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:52.250
Passing Examinees

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.090
What now? Want to stop by my place?

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.680
I'm gonna head home for today.

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:01.370
I want to conquer the black-hearted, 
sadistic prince by tonight.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:04.140
You've really gotten 
into <i>Fortune Lover</i>, huh?

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:05.610
Okay, good luck.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.180
Thanks! See you tomorrow!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.000
<i>I took for granted that those 
days would last forever...</i>

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.530
<i>but they ended so suddenly.</i>

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:34.500
<i>She was involved in a traffic 
accident on the way to school.</i>

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.880
<i>She'll never come back.</i>

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:01.400
Acchan, I can't conquer 
the black-hearted, sadistic prince!

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:08.340
This was her last message to me?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.450
Acchan, I can't conquer 
the black-hearted, sadistic prince!

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:25.430
<i>From now on, I'll have to 
live my life without her.</i>

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:29.780
<i>I'll carry on in the new world 
that she gave me.</i>

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:37.160
<i>So if I have a chance 
to be reborn when my life ends,</i>

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:41.800
<i>I want to be friends with her again.</i>

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:55.050
Why am I...

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.700
Heave-ho...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.150
and here we go!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.660
Lady Catarina!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:06.170
Morning, Sophia. Is something wrong?

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.810
I had a very sad dream,

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.930
and suddenly, I wanted to see you.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.030
A dream?

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:16.700
Yes. It was a very, very sad dream.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:20.210
I don't remember what 
happened in it very clearly,

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.580
but I think it was something 
that happened long ago.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.340
Long ago?

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.660
I don't mean when I was a child.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:31.310
Much, much longer ago than that...

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.960
This all sounds very strange, doesn't it?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.540
No, it doesn't.

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:41.090
Bad dreams happen sometimes 
when you're nervous.

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.540
Nervous?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.960
We have exams starting today, right?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:48.620
I'm sure you had a sad dream 
because you're nervous about that.

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:52.050
But don't worry! I'm just as nervous as you!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:54.240
Let's both do our best on the exams!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.320
Okay.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.590
I hate exams!

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:02.650
I just want to play all the time!

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.580
How long are you going to act 
as if it's still summer vacation?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:09.730
If we don't pass the exam, 
we won't advance to the next grade.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.140
But whether or not we get to 
the next grade isn't what's important.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:16.150
It's whether or not we get the doom ending!

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:20.460
Maria doesn't seem to be in love 
with anyone at the moment.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.620
She didn't have any summer flings, either!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:28.090
We should continue our observation 
of developments in Maria's love life.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.750
But right now, we need to focus on the exam.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.330
If we don't advance to the next grade...

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.970
Catarina!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:38.170
<i>How could you fail to advance 
to the next grade?!</i>

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:39.720
We'll get the doom ending 
when our own mother kills us!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.070
L-Let's focus on the exam.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.940
No objections!

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:49.770
Your practical exam will consist 
of exploring these ancient ruins.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:54.000
Deep in these ruins, where it's said 
that a great mage once lived,

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.860
there is a stone inhabited by magical power.

00:07:57.010 --> 00:08:00.320
The team that brings it 
back here will pass the exam.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:02.660
It's a bit like a treasure hunt, isn't it?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:04.340
Yeah. Sounds like fun!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:07.290
Everyone, do not take this task lightly.

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.140
The ruins are as complex 
as a maze on the inside.

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:15.550
In addition, there are various 
traps set at every turn.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.860
Traps?

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:22.780
I heard that the great mage set traps 
to protect his magic tools from thieves.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:26.240
Those traps still deter invaders to this day.

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:28.940
And they're tossing students 
into a place like that?

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:32.830
These teachers and second-years 
are here to serve as aides in the exam,

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:35.540
but still, you must not get careless.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:40.000
Demonstrate your command of your 
own magic and everything you've learned

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.670
to make your way 
into the depths of the ruins.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:46.670
Now, each team may proceed 
to their chosen entrance.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:47.340
Yes, sir.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.130
You two are on the same 
team as Prince Alan, right?

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:50.970
Yes.

00:08:50.970 --> 00:08:55.400
I'm sad that you and I will be 
separated, but I'll do my best!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:58.150
I'm worried about you, for many reasons.

00:08:58.150 --> 00:08:59.230
Be careful.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.100
I will!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:02.960
Let's do our best with our team, too.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:03.790
Right!

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:05.130
Catarina...

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:08.380
Don't leave my side once we're 
inside the ruins, all right?

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:10.730
You can count on me to look after my sister.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.340
You really do follow us everywhere, 
don't you, Keith?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.720
It was the teachers who chose 
the teams, Prince Geordo.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.740
You may follow us, but that's all.

00:09:18.970 --> 00:09:20.160
Did you say something?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.150
She hardly even has any magic.

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.820
Such jokes won't work with me.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:25.340
Must be nice to have so many 
people around to help her out.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:28.370
She even has princes 
helping her. It's not fair!

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:30.840
I see you're all together.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.280
As you've heard, 
this exam is very dangerous.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.550
Be careful.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.050
And good luck.

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:46.950
It looks like the setting for a novel.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.730
Yeah. It's so dark and spooky.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:52.450
If you're scared, do you want me 
to hold your hand, Sister?

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:57.600
As her fiancé, it's my job 
to escort her, Keith.

00:09:57.600 --> 00:10:01.900
As her family, it's my job 
to protect her, Prince Geordo.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:03.280
Huh?

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.730
I wonder what this is...

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:10.820
What happened?!

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.650
Sister!

00:10:20.650 --> 00:10:22.310
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:25.110
Try not to touch anything! 
It's too dangerous!

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.810
What's that?

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.740
We won't be able to get past that ice.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.780
But there's no other way.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.030
We'll just have to break through it.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.880
I see.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:49.580
This is a test to see 
whether or not we can get through.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.730
Everyone, stay back. This will be dangerous.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.400
That's amazing, Prince Geordo!

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.490
Look!

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.350
Let's hurry through it.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:25.490
Right!

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:34.340
It's so dark... I hope 
Lady Catarina is doing all right.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.050
She'll be fine. Geordo's with her.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.160
That's exactly what I'm worried about.

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:44.300
Lady Mary, Prince Alan, what's that?

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:48.140
It's the stone inhabited by magical power!

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.880
This means we'll pass the exam!

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:53.860
Wait!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.590
Don't tell me this is...

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.860
Run, both of you!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.120
Are you all right?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.370
Yes...

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:22.240
I can't believe I fell for that trap. 
How careless of me.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:26.490
Still, this exam is much more 
dangerous than I expected.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.790
Which way should we go?

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.940
Oh, there's something written here.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:39.100
It's an ancient script.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.200
I can't read it at all!

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.490
We've been learning ancient 
script in class, Sister.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.830
Some of the characters have faded, though.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:49.890
"You who wander within the labyrinth,

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:54.290
if you go east..." 
I can't read the next part.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.400
I know what it is!

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.550
"If you go east, 
you will only march in place.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:01.410
If you go west, you will struggle 
to follow a strenuous path.

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:04.300
Only the adventurer may 
proceed beyond the light."

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.300
This is a verse from a poem.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:09.120
I'm amazed you knew that, Sophia!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.210
I read it once before.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.810
What could it mean, though?

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:16.750
I guess it means we should go west, 
even if the path is strenuous.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.030
I agree.

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.170
Going east may lead to a dead end.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:21.970
Then we need to go that way!

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.960
You always start with the dead 
ends in a dungeon! It's a rule!

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:27.780
There could be treasure chests there!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.530
What are you talking about, Sister?

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.920
Let's go.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.490
Huh? Wait... What?!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:40.130
It's not a dead end, 
but we can't go any farther.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.270
We just need to swim across!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.090
Something's in there!

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:47.840
What do we do?!

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.350
Leave this one to me, Sister!

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.180
That was rather impressive.

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.170
Yes, incredible!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.980
Thanks, Keith!

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:12.870
All right, let's go.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:20.430
<i>I wish I could be useful to them, too...</i>

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.880
Everyone, look out!

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.970
Come forth, Earth Bump!

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.000
Now we can get past it with no problem.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.350
Well done, Lady Catarina!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.150
Yes, you've saved the day.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.100
Great job, Sister.

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.440
I'm glad my Earth Bump came in handy!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.230
Huh?

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:49.560
Prince Geordo!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.830
Stay back, Sister!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.300
Is everyone all right?

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.220
Catarina?

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.110
Sister, where are you?!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:17.120
Ow...

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.270
Where am I?

00:15:19.750 --> 00:15:21.350
What do I do now?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.400
I got separated from the others!

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.320
Prince Geordo!

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:29.950
Keith!

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.350
Sophia!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.780
Where are they?

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:38.050
I never expected her to get lost!

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:39.900
Who would've thought 
she'd trigger a doom flag

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:42.210
in a way that had nothing to do 
with the game's plot?!

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:44.400
Well, our only choice is to keep moving!

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:46.280
Let's keep looking for a way out!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.830
We don't want to waste 
energy running around blindly.

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:52.180
Let's wait for help to arrive.

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.530
What are you doing?

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:55.730
Looking for food!

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:58.640
We'll last longer if we have food, right?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.910
Oh! Found some!

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:01.650
Ugh!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:04.720
I don't think it's 
a good idea to eat that...

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:06.340
Isn't there anything else?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:08.780
Oh, I found more!

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.690
This'll hold me for a while.

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:16.020
There's no way I'm going to die here!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.470
Is someone there?

00:16:24.940 --> 00:16:26.320
Wait!

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.130
Brother!

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.940
Sophia? Did something happen?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.340
We've lost Lady Catarina!

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:42.280
She disappeared while we 
were preoccupied with a trap.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:45.140
Master Nicol, have you seen my sister?

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.570
No, she hasn't been this way.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:49.730
What is it? Did something happen?

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.860
Everyone...

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.860
Lady Catarina is lost?!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:56.860
Where could she have gone?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.680
I hope she didn't get caught in a trap.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:04.510
<i>That sad dream I had this morning...</i>

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:05.820
<i>Could it have been...</i>

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:09.360
You okay, Sophia?

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:14.460
I have a bad feeling. 
We have to find Lady Catarina!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:15.940
A bad feeling?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.720
Where are you?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.300
Lady Catarina!

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:27.480
That's it! Her voice!

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.430
I'm going to pick up Catarina's voice.

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:33.020
Pick up her voice? How?

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.240
With wind magic?

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.190
Exactly.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.630
I can pick up people's voices 
with my wind magic.

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:42.360
It should tell us which direction she's in.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:43.860
Give it a try.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:44.670
Right.

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.720
I'll help you!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.040
That's weird.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:17.400
I'm sure I heard footsteps.

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.570
I found more!

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:27.420
Mushrooms!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:30.710
Mushrooms?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.140
Mushrooms!

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:35.330
That was definitely Lady Catarina's voice!

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.470
What does "mushrooms" mean?

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.000
She didn't eat mushrooms, did she?

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.720
I'm just glad she's all right!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.220
Let's go!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.340
They're so hard to break loose.

00:18:59.230 --> 00:19:02.740
This many should keep me alive 
for a good, long time!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:06.630
I wish I had some soy sauce, 
but beggars can't be choosers.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:12.190
Is someone there?

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:26.450
I refuse...

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:30.480
to meet my doom here!

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.920
Sophia!

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.160
Let go, Sophia!

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:45.400
No! I won't let go!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:47.040
Never ever!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.910
I don't ever want to lose you again!

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.210
Ouch...

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.890
Are you okay, Sophia?

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:18.620
Yes. What about you? Are you hurt?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:20.540
I'm just fine!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.430
Thank goodness!

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:29.280
Please don't ever leave 
again, Lady Catarina!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:33.160
Okay. I won't go anywhere.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.230
Thank you for saving me, Sophia.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:40.430
Was that whirlwind your magic?

00:20:40.430 --> 00:20:42.880
No, it wasn't me.

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.980
Then... what was it?

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:50.900
Catarina!

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:52.440
Sister!

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:54.130
You're all right?

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:55.160
Yeah.

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:56.930
You all came to find me?

00:20:56.930 --> 00:20:59.320
Thank goodness, Lady Catarina!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.070
Sorry for worrying you.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:05.090
Hey, that stone...

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.460
It's the stone inhabited by magical power!

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.700
Th-This thing?

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.870
You did it, Lady Catarina!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.800
Now we'll pass the exam!

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:16.160
Where did you find it?

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.840
Um, actually...

00:21:21.100 --> 00:21:24.380
This many should keep me alive 
for a good, long time!

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:28.240
I was so hungry, I got 
absorbed in mushroom hunting,

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:32.660
so I didn't even realize it was 
the stone inhabited by magical power.

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:37.060
You never change, Sister.

00:21:37.340 --> 00:21:41.810
Catarina remains strong and reliable, 
no matter the situation she's in.

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:42.670
Yeah.

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:49.720
<i>What was that?</i>

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:53.920
Okay! We're having a mushroom party today!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.580
You want us to eat those?

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.130
That color looks kind of poisonous...

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:01.850
If Lady Catarina offers me food, 
I'll eat it even if it means my death!

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:03.550
M-Me, too!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.620
Th-That's really not necessary!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.060
I'm making mushroom broth!

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.060
No! Don't eat it!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:09.970
What is "mushroom broth"?
